                "wrong_account": "A bank or money transfer was sent to the wrong account or recipient, or submitted using incorrect destination account details. Includes questions about recovering or correcting such transfers, even if they are also pending or failed.",
                "other": "Unrelated requests, other transfer issues, general transfer timing or instructions without a pending, failed, or wrong-account issue, or insufficient evidence to identify one of the three issues."
